Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:05.15,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,A date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:08.20,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.36,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Where did that come from, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Is that a no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:15.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,We should still have a whole day \Nbefore DEM's assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:20.36,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,That's true, but there's \Nno need to train for that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,This isn't for training!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:27.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,With the final battle drawing near,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:29.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,that's all the more reason \NI want to invite you on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:33.51,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Do the others know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.03,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I haven't told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.01,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:39.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.97,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I haven't said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:45.60,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,but if you wanted to go on a date with someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.40,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,then you should have other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I want to go on a date with you, Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.34,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'll make some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.67,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:34.78,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:38.51,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine is your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:43.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're shocked to hear \Nall of this so suddenly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:47.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:49.24,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was hard for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thank you for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:57.15,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Well then, let's come up with \Na strategy without Reine noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.22,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:05.91,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,To start, we'll have to think of \Nwhat to do for Reine's date by morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:10.67,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,all while simultaneously \Npreparing our strategies against DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's true, also...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Deal with the other Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:17.18,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:22.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine was a reliable older sister \Nthey all could trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:25.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,When they learn that she betrayed them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.65,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.77,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Though we'll need them to get over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:35.31,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HE9E2D7&\3c&H857C67&\shad0\fs16}Origami Tobiichi\N Cell Phone\N Calling\N Answer Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:39.20,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,I heard what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:39.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:42.74,Main - Italics,Origami,0,0,0,,I've informed all the Spirits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:45.96,Main - Italics,Origami,0,0,0,,We'll help you compose your date plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.58,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.18,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,How did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:54.70,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido, your second button.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:55.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:56.96,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I understand what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:03.22,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I heard the details from Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:06.85,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,That was a surprise, \Nbut there's no time to be depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:11.26,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Now these are some hot developments \Nhappening without my knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.60,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I kind of like this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.74,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Impressive, Reine Murasame!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.44,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,You managed to deceive Kaguya Yamai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:23.24,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Petition. Please let us help you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.01,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.29,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Then assemble in the briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:31.97,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Go one at a time so Reine \Ndoesn't catch on if you run into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kotori, could you give me a bit of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.38,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.14,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:44.87,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:47.41,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're there, right, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.53,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My, my, this is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:02.94,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're actually summoning me for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Are you the only one here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:08.74,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Is the real Kurumi listening \Ninto this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:11.70,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You ask quite the odd question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:17.54,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,None of the other clones \Nor the real me are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:21.93,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,If you want to discuss something \Nyou don't want the real me to hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:24.42,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,then you're safe on that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:33.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I don't know if what I'm about to tell you \Nis safe to pass on to the real Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.63,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,So could you listen \Nand make that decision for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.86,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,On February 20th, the real Kurumi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:49.90,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You speak like you've actually seen it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, your guess is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:56.34,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Who are you suggesting \Nmanaged to take me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.94,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Even if I'm about to face Ellen Mathers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:04.38,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I won't go down that easily, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It was Mio Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:11.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The Spirit of Origin will kill Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:15.57,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio suddenly appeared from within \NKurumi on the future battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I believe Mio is already inside of Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.28,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,So that's what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.97,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:31.41,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're right, this isn't information \Nto be handled carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:32.96,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:36.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Do you think you can convey this \Nto Kurumi without Mio catching wind of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.86,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Most likely, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:43.79,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Though, the real problem is \Nwhat to do about it afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I hope there's something \NI can do to help, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:53.19,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Please don't make such a sad face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:57.89,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I know this is a desperate situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:01.87,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,but thanks to you I now have options.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:10.07,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido, was I able to fulfill \Nmy duty in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, in the coolest way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.98,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:36.18,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,R-Reine?! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:38.29,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.57,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I figured I would take care of \Ntomorrow's work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:43.81,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I finally finished up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.21,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.48,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Good work, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:49.28,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,And what are you up to at this hour, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:51.95,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,W-Well, um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:54.10,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,If you want a late-night snack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:56.74,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,you should go to the cafeteria \Nor the break area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:01.21,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Though go easy on the snacks, \Ngiven how late it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.48,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,And don't forget to \Nbrush your teeth before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.96,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.42,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I understand why you can't sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.41,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,but make sure to get rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:17.33,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,We have to do everything we can \Nto protect Shin from DEM, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:19.83,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:20.97,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:24.48,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Reine... do you like Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.35,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.89,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.38,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Just answer the question. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:33.31,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:38.33,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I see. Yeah. Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:50.17,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,No, I'm overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:09:01.14,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(468.667,148)\c&HC1BDB4&\3c&HE7E4DD&\shad0\fs14}Amamiya Station
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.46,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,Hello, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:57.17,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,How's the bone conduction receiver working?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:58.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I can hear you clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:01.14,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Though it is slightly different than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.38,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine would catch on \Nif we used the usual transceiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.53,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,We won't have to worry about \Nher noticing with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:10.24,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,She should be arriving soon, so get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:11.15,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.89,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hey, did I keep you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:18.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,R-Reine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.05,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It's finally starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:40.71,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Now, let our date begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.90,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Honestly, I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.94,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Our Reine is Phantom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.28,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:59.82,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,But we have to accept the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:03.90,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Still, it's not something \Nto be pessimistic about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:09.58,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,According to the boy, the friendship \Nshe feels toward us is the real deal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.34,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:15.14,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,So in short, as long as Shido can make \NReine fall for him and seal her power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.22,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,then all of this will be resolved peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:20.02,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.02,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Did I shock you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Oh, no, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:26.64,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,150)\fs18\3c&HF9CF44&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&}1) I'm sorry, I was captivated by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.64,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,225)\fs18\3c&H47F5C4&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&}2) That's not your usual hairstyle, is it? It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.64,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,302)\fs18\3c&HAB61E9&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&}3) What'll it take to let me strip that outfit off of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:28.31,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Everyone, choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:29.69,Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.24,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,1, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.69,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That's most reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:36.00,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:39.82,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think going silent \Nwould only make her anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:42.95,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But if he says that, she'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:46.53,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Such consideration! Are you a goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:49.42,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,What does it say about me \Nthat I chose the other
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.83,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,because I think we should wait and see for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:55.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes, I think Reine \Nwill approve of this one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:11:00.38,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm. I don't think 2 is a bad choice either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.97,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.32,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.10,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,God dwells in the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:08.92,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,It's important to notice \Nthe minor changes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:11.30,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Addendum. Depending on the person,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:15.37,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,some might take it as suggesting \Ntheir usual hairstyle isn't that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:18.49,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,I think we should play it safe \Nand wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:21.99,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,So, what do you three think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:25.45,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,No, it's clearly 3 here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:28.50,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Hearing such a surprising comeback \Nfrom such an innocent young boy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.37,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,would really turn a lady on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.40,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.86,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Reine is a mature woman, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:38.13,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,so she'll appreciate wit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:40.02,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:44.26,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,our future is riding on this, \Nso could you please take this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:46.23,Main,Origiami,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:50.77,Main,Origiami,0,0,0,,That's why we chose the line that \Nwould make us the happiest to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:54.77,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido, go with 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:12:02.05,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I've never seen you dressed \Nlike this before, so well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.28,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I was captivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.54,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:08.13,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:10.46,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:12.50,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.42,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Your outfit is wonderful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.92,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.18,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Now, where are we going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.50,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It looks like you brought a lot of luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.17,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's still a secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I want to surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.22,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Will you trust me and follow along?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:30.91,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:33.18,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shall we go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:35.19,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:38.66,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,This is technically a date, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:41.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. No technically about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.45,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:56.71,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.11,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:04.70,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Her affection rating... \Nis a strange wave pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:08.80,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It looks like she holds enough affection \Nfor us to be able to seal her at any moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.60,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,but it's not triggering \Nthe possibility to seal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:14.25,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,It's like she holds deep affection for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.78,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,but she's keeping herself at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:18.70,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,Almost like she's affectionately \Nwatching over him from the sidelines
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:21.36,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,while everyone else \Ngets to be on stage with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:24.36,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,One could also say it's like a mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:27.69,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I see, that's oddly well put.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:31.97,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Either way, it doesn't change the fact \Nshe'll be a difficult target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:36.37,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:39.00,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Reine's affection is climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:41.63,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,Looks like your strategy \Nis working, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.26,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It wasn't solely my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:49.01,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It's the result of all of us spirits \Nironing out a plan until late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:52.06,Main,Mikimoto,0,0,0,,A day trip to a hot springs inn on the weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:55.02,Main,Mikimoto,0,0,0,,This really is an attractive choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:14:00.48,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,Analyst Murasame is the one \Nwho works the most in Fraxinus, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.48,0:14:04.65,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,She also works as a teacher \Nat Raizen High on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:11.41,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,She's also been working to revive \NShinji Takamiya for decades as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:14.91,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Even if she is a Spirit, it's only \Nnatural that's she built up fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:19.54,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Reine always does have bags under her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.79,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I thought she must be struggling with her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:26.80,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I'm sure she doesn't get \Nmuch sleep every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:30.43,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Her mind and body should both \Nbe completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:33.93,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,So what Reine needs is relaxation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:36.88,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,She can use the various relaxation services
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:40.19,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,to relieve her pent up weariness and fatigue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.39,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.44,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,90)\fs18\3c&HFBF565&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz341}1) Take it easy and stretch out in the large bath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.44,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,190)\fs18\3c&H5FF8D2&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz341}2) Relax in the private outdoor bath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:46.44,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,302)\fs18\3c&HCEA4EA&\b1\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz341}3) Get a refreshing massage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:48.19,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Everyone, choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.57,Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:54.08,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Hmm, yeah, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:15:01.83,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes, though I don't feel good about Reine \Nand Shido taking a bath alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:03.00,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:07.46,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think they both need to \Nbe able to talk a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:12.74,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'm calm. I'm calm. I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:15.45,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Why did you need to say that thrice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:20.49,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Besides, I've been alone \Nin the bath with Shido, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:24.15,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be losing my calm \Nover something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:25.19,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:28.65,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That was when you were lying in wait \Nto ambush him, wasn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.94,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,You can't leave us Yamai sisters out \Nwhen it comes to bathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.10,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:39.04,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Sandwiching Shido between me \Nand Kaguya was a nice memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:42.04,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,They should be spending \Nsome time naked together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.42,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,since they're at a hot springs inn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.42,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Right in a bath tub about this big!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:50.30,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Both Darling and Reine packed in tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:56.05,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,It's the world's greatest packed lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:58.18,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido, go with 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.68,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:11.56,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shin, can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.03,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:17.53,Main,Mikimoto,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:19.83,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.08,Main,Mikimoto,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.73,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,I can't see Analyst Murasame's na—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:26.58,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,No, I can't see our important conquest screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:30.46,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Dear god! Bring it back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:34.82,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Our objective is to make \Nthe Spirit fall for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.82,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,I believe it best to avoid doing things
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.35,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Reine would find unpleasant \Nafter we've sealed her spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.68,Main,Three,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:47.63,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kannazuki, you're still calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:49.85,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:53.74,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Because I don't have \Nmuch interest in big breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.41,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:02.25,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,We're all alone, so you don't mind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.33,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,Those are quite something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:13.63,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Um, Reine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,how long have you been with Ratatoskr?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:19.07,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It was around five or six years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:23.26,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It was around the same time \NKotori became the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:24.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:28.02,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You know, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:29.57,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:33.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Well, that means you've been \Nsupporting Kotori all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:37.82,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:42.91,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm sure she would be a great \Ncommander even without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:50.04,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Well, I won't deny that Kotori is talented, \Nbut what did you do before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:52.43,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I was your typical student.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:57.05,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,My thesis got recognition, \Nso I was scouted for Ratatoskr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:03.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Was there anyone you fell in love with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:08.81,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,There was one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.55,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:19.05,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's not fair to talk about just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.09,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Would you tell me more about yourself, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:22.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:25.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:29.66,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to hear more \Nabout you for a long time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.22,0:18:34.85,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything that happened \Nbefore you were taken in by the Itsuka family?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:42.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't really have \Nany clear memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:44.60,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What I do remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:47.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,is the sensation of being held by warm hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:51.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and a sense of loss like those hands \Nwere leaving me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:52.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,that must have been my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:19:00.61,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Do you resent your mother for abandoning you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:01.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:05.87,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I don't resent her or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.87,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sure she had her reasons for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:13.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I doubt she abandoned me because she wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:16.34,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Besides, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:20.23,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I remember how kind \Nthe hands that held me were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:22.57,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:33.57,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:36.33,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:39.65,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Hey, Reine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.22,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,A little of this won't hurt, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:45.94,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Though I may not be able to replace her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:53.52,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Ellen, sorry for the suddenness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.65,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,but I've decided to speed up our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.02,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,The situation has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:01.56,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Rather, it seems it's about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.68,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Ike?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:08.22,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Honestly, I really am fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:10.50,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Never before have I felt like it was destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:16.06,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,that the omniscient Beelzebub \Nwas the first Demon King I obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:20.33,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Meaning you've learned \Nsome new fact through Beelzebub?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:22.69,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:27.38,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Apparently we've already suffered \Npainful defeat once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:29.93,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,In a future unknown to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:34.85,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,However, this time we can strike first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:37.96,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Start preparing the magic reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:41.37,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,We'll want absorption charms as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:44.72,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Then the Spirit of Origin...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.46,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Come on, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:51.69,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's change the future as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:14.39,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,What is it you wanted to show me, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:16.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.47,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You can open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.27,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,This is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.07,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,This is the place I wanted to show you, Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.47,0:21:40.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It's pretty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.53,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Yes, it is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:51.13,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Very much so.
